<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY LEAGUE-NEW SOUTH WALES BEAT QUEENSLAND 15-14.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-NEW SOUTH WALES BEAT QUEENSLAND 15-14.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the second game in</p>
<p>the three-match Australian Rugby League State of Origin series</p>
<p>at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Wednesday:</p>
<p> New South Wales    15  Queensland    14</p>
<p>(New South Wales take a winning 2-0 lead in the series)</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,015</p>
</text>
